<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse to allow Thai Danu to trade May 27.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse to allow Thai Danu to trade May 27.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand said it would allow a resumption of trading in suspended Thai Danu Bank Plc on May 27 after the company reported on its failed merger with Finance One on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The SET decided to lift suspension and allow trading in Thai Danu on Tuesday,&quot; the SET spokesman Suvicha Mingkwan told reporters.</p>
</text>
